title: NeveFirst
---
Neve: Shapers in the lanes. I thought those were expensive warning lights. #emotion:Amused
Taren: Only if we hit something. #emotion:Neutral
Neve: The Choir has closed the Gullet's chambers. Kill the singers and the membranes loosen. Do not lean on the walls. #emotion:Worried
Neve: I left a cache in the second chamber. Copper beacon, cracked casing. Tell it I sent you. #emotion:Determined
<<setFlag neve.cache>>
===
title: NeveRepeat
---
Neve: The cache is yours. My advice costs more: brake before you turn. #emotion:Smug
===
title: NevePost
---
Neve: That key is humming. Either it works or it is very pleased with itself. #emotion:Curious
Neve: Follow the beacon through the Gullet. Tallow Drift is still answering. #emotion:Determined
===
